Z||000000||rogergarrison||12-12-2001||07:27 AM||||Finally saw it last nite. A little too much mush but flying and battle scenes were pretty good. I did spot one huge blooper, anyone else see any? This japanse plane smackes into a tall tower high up on 4 legs. It comes to an immediate 50G stop and fall down on the ground, nearly undamaged. Those tower legs and the aluminum and bamboo Zero are pretty damn strong  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> In reality, the plane would slice thru the tower like butter, breaking up into parts scattered for a 1/2 mile.||||reg||1
