Z||000008||rogergarrison||12-12-2001||09:11 PM||||The Zero being a lot lighter, could out turn and out manuever most. Even F4u Corsair had a problem with them. The strategy usually was diving down on them, or pairing up on them and flying 'sissor' pattern catching them in crossfire. The Zero had no kind of protection from shells, no pilot armour, no self seal fuel tanks. There worse problem was all their decent pilots were wiped out at Midway.||||reg||1
